  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "……你就是侦探吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620264F605C31662F4FA663A25417FF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是代理",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4EE374060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "算了，既然是玛琪艾儿派来的人，\n那应该没问题吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B974E86FF0C65E27136662F739B742A827E513F6D3E676576844EBAFF0C000A90A35E948BE56CA195EE98985427300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那让我们马上进入正题！\n在密阿雷出现了不得了的家伙。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A38BA962114EEC9A6C4E0A8FDB51656B639898FF01000A57285BC6963F96F751FA73B04E864E0D5F974E8676845BB64F19300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F2026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超～～～巨大的～<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85FF5EFF5EFF5E5DE859277684FF5E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘掘兔！！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639863985154FF01FF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它的大小非同一般，\n比我的掘掘兔大一倍以上，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而且双眼还闪闪发光！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83768459275C0F975E540C4E00822CFF0C000A6BD46211768463986398515459274E00500D4EE54E0AFF0C00100001BE00000A800C4E1453CC773C8FD895EA95EA53D15149FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和它对上眼的瞬间，\n我就本能地逃跑了……！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n尽管我游历各地经历过各种事情，\n但也没体验过这样的恐惧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C5B835BF94E0A773C768477AC95F4FF0C000A62115C31672C80FD573090038DD14E8620262026FF0100100001BE01000A5C3D7BA162116E385386540457307ECF53868FC7540479CD4E8B60C5FF0C000A4F464E5F6CA14F539A8C8FC78FD968377684605060E7300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "更可怕的是我目击到它的地点。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那是普通的巷子……\n是在野生特区的外面！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66F453EF60157684662F621176EE51FB52305B837684573070B9300200100001BE01000A90A3662F666E901A76845DF75B5020262026000A662F572891CE751F7279533A768459169762FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可不能放着那家伙不管。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n快把我的任务<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>添加到导航<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，\n然后到目的地来吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4E0D80FD653E774090A35BB64F194E0D7BA1300200100001BE01000A5FEB628A621176844EFB52A100100002FF0000066DFB52A052305BFC822A00100002FF000000FF0C000A7136540E523076EE7684573067655427FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿嘿！\n我的膝盖在发抖……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n巨大的掘掘兔就在这附近。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563F563FFF01000A62117684819D76D6572853D162962026202600100001BE01000A5DE8592776846398639851545C3157288FD996448FD1300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C7FF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "搭档你怎么了？\n难道是……那家伙！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "642D68634F60600E4E484E86FF1F000A96BE9053662F2026202690A35BB64F19FF01FF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘噜噜！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6398565C565CFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好巨大！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5DE85927FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好可怕！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D53EF6015FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好厉害！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D53895BB3FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是这家伙！不会错！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8FD95BB64F19FF014E0D4F1A9519FF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘噜噜～啊～！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6398565C565CFF5E554AFF5EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真厉害！居然能\n打赢那只巨大的掘掘兔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F53895BB3FF015C45713680FD000A62538D6290A353EA5DE859277684639863985154300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说看了刚才的战斗，\n我想起了一件事。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF4770B4E86521A624D768462186597FF0C000A621160F38D774E864E004EF64E8B300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说在很久以前，\n某个地方的人们将他们害怕的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n体型巨大，眼睛发光的凶暴宝可梦称为<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>头目<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF457285F884E454EE5524DFF0C000A67D04E2A573065B976844EBA4EEC5C064ED64EEC5BB36015768400100001BE00000A4F53578B5DE85927FF0C773C775B53D15149768451F666B45B9D53EF68A679F04E3A00100002FF000006593476EE00100002FF000000300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为什么在现代的密阿雷市\n会出现与那相似的宝可梦？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我真是想不明白啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4EC04E48572873B04EE376845BC6963F96F75E02000A4F1A51FA73B04E0E90A376F84F3C76845B9D53EF68A6FF1F00100001BE01000A6211771F662F60F34E0D660E767D554A2026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿，搭档。\n你有没有种不好的预感？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563FFF0C642D68633002000A4F6067096CA1670979CD4E0D597D76849884611FFF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘挖噜……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63986316565C202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总之你帮大忙了。\n不愧是玛琪艾儿派来的人啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n只要有像你这样的人，\n即使市里出现头目也不用怕了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B4E4B4F605E2E59275FD94E863002000A4E0D6127662F739B742A827E513F6D3E676576844EBA554A300200100001BE01000A53EA8981670950CF4F608FD9683776844EBAFF0C000A53734F7F5E0291CC51FA73B0593476EE4E5F4E0D752860154E86FF0100100002011401260000",
